## QDRANT REST API CONTRACT

Base URL: {{QDRANT_URL}} (default: http://localhost:6333)
Auth: X-API-Key header (omit for no-auth in-cluster deployment)
Content-Type: application/json
Response envelope: {"result": ..., "status": "ok", "time": 0.001}
Error envelope: {"status": {"error": "..."}, "time": 0.001}

API version compatibility: Qdrant REST API v1.x
  All endpoints prefixed with /collections, /points, /aliases, /cluster, /snapshots
  No versioned URL prefix — paths are flat: GET /collections, PUT /collections/{name}

Qdrant Cloud management API:
  Base URL: {{QDRANT_CLOUD_URL}} (default: https://api.cloud.qdrant.io)
  Auth: Authorization: Bearer {{QDRANT_CLOUD_KEY}}
  Account scope: /accounts/{{QDRANT_ACCOUNT_ID}}/...

