### Search (2 tools)

#### qdrant_search_points
  Description: Nearest-neighbor vector search with optional payload filtering
  Args:
    collection_name: str
    vector: list[float]         — query vector (must match collection vector_size)
    limit: int (default 10)     — max results to return
    score_threshold: float (opt) — minimum similarity score (0.0–1.0 for Cosine)
    filter: dict (optional)     — pre-filter payload before vector search
    with_payload: bool (default True)
    with_vectors: bool (default False)
    offset: int (default 0)
  API: POST /collections/{collection_name}/points/search
  Returns: [{id, score, payload, vector?}] sorted by score descending
  Score interpretation (Cosine): 1.0 = identical, 0.0 = orthogonal, -1.0 = opposite
  Pre-filter vs post-filter: filter runs BEFORE vector search (efficient for indexed fields)

#### qdrant_query_points
  Description: Universal query API — search, recommend, discover, hybrid
  Args:
    collection_name: str
    query: dict              — query type selector:
      For search:    {"nearest": [float,...]}
      For recommend: {"recommend": {"positive": [id,...], "negative": [id,...]}}
      For discover:  {"discover": {"target": [float,...], "context": [...]}}
    limit: int (default 10)
    filter: dict (optional)
    with_payload: bool (default True)
    prefetch: list[dict] (optional) — multi-stage query pipeline (Phase 3)
  API: POST /collections/{collection_name}/points/query
  Use query_points for hybrid/multi-stage when search_points is insufficient

