### Indexes (2 tools)

#### qdrant_create_index
  Description: Create a payload field index to accelerate filtered searches
  Args:
    collection_name: str
    field_name: str       — payload field path to index (e.g. "tags", "project", "date")
    field_schema: str     — "keyword" | "integer" | "float" | "geo" | "datetime" | "text"
  API: PUT /collections/{collection_name}/index
  Body: {"field_name": str, "field_schema": str}
  ⚠ Index only fields you actually filter on — indexes consume RAM
  Common patterns:
    "project" → keyword    (equality filter: match.value)
    "tags" → keyword       (array contains filter: match.any)
    "timestamp" → datetime (range filter: range.gt/lt)
    "severity" → integer   (range filter)
    "content" → text       (full-text search within payload)

#### qdrant_delete_index
  Description: Remove a payload field index
  Args:
    collection_name: str
    field_name: str
  API: DELETE /collections/{collection_name}/index/{field_name}

